# Lumine Mobile — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values before running on a device.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real values.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend API URL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# On Android emulator: use http://10.0.2.2:8000 (emulator maps this to host)
# On physical device or Expo Go: use your machine's LAN IP
#   Mac/Linux: run `ifconfig | grep "inet "` to find your IP
#   Windows:   run `ipconfig` and look for IPv4 Address
#   WSL2:      run `ip route show | grep default` — use the host IP shown
#
# Docker: make sure port 8000 is exposed (it is, in docker-compose.yml)
#
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.100:8000
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_LAN_IP:8000
